 "description": "<p>Quantum ransomware group was discovered on 15th of July 2021. This ransomware group, probably, uses Mount locker ransomware that encrypts user data with RSA 2048+ ChaCha 20 and then demands a BTC ransom to get the files back.</p><p>DLS (Data Leaks Site): hxxp://quantum445bh3gzuyilxdzs5xdepf3b7lkcupswvkryf3n7hgzpxebid[.]onion/</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>According to researchers, the Quantum group includes members of Conti, a prolific cybercrime group that recently shuttered its ransomware operations and data-leak site.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat_actor/3d86fa0fce495ea07d119f7e381e1c857b69de29/file/17a4081306cdb9ecaf5fc48c5cc1ffb8e2b4c8b5a2f03d9bd54877819aa26016?placeholder=__IMAGE_3d86fa0fce495ea07d119f7e381e1c857b69de29:17a4081306cdb9ecaf5fc48c5cc1ffb8e2b4c8b5a2f03d9bd54877819aa26016_IMAGE__\"  /></figure><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat_actor/3d86fa0fce495ea07d119f7e381e1c857b69de29/file/8319b76f48375f8915ac2ed42222396c84b4155c615d0901b6b0d503aac7c02c?placeholder=__IMAGE_3d86fa0fce495ea07d119f7e381e1c857b69de29:8319b76f48375f8915ac2ed42222396c84b4155c615d0901b6b0d503aac7c02c_IMAGE__\"  /></figure><p>It is known that Cobalt Strike beacons that were used in Play's attacks bear the same watermark, 206546002, as those previously dropped by Emotet and SVCReady botnets that have also been observed in Quantum ransomware attacks. This suggests that the two ransomware groups share some of the same infrastructure.<br>Presumably, this watermark is connected to groups composed of former members of the Trickbot/Conti syndicate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Watermark 305419776 also was detected in Quantum's attack.<br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Quantum's DLS hasn't been updated since November 2022.</p>",
